+// The on-screen display. F8 shows the window title's stats over the picture, and the quick save
+// (F5) and quick load (F6) report there. The text is drawn with GDI into an RGBA image that the
+// WebGPU presenter blends over the top-left corner (Windows; elsewhere the title keeps the stats).
+struct OsdLine {
+    std::string text;
+    std::uint32_t rgb;
